    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-ps22">
        <head xml:id="gom-ps22-Hd1e98">Psalmus 22</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps22-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps22-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_1@1-2">Psalmus David.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps22-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-ps22-Nd1e110" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e113">Propheta reditum populi de Babylone praedixit.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e116">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e118" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_1@3-5">Dominus regit me.</quote>
            Psalmus de misericordia, enumerans decem gratias, ut omnes sperent in misericordia Dei.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e122">
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps22-Rd1e124" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_1@3-5"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps22-Rd1e126"><name xml:id="gom-ps22-Nd1e127" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e130">Ecclesia loquitur de Christo.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps22-Dd1e134">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps22-Hd1e136">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e138">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e140" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_2@1-3">In loco pascuae.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps22-Rd1e143"><name xml:id="gom-ps22-Nd1e144" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e147">Prima gratia, ocus pascuae, id est, sermo divinus, qui saginat meditantes. <pb ed="#P" n="0876A"/></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e152">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e154" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_2@7-8">Super aquam.</quote>
            Secunda gratia, aqua refectionis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps22-Dd1e159">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps22-Hd1e161">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e163">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e165" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_3@1-2">Animam meam.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps22-Rd1e168"><name xml:id="gom-ps22-Nd1e169" ref="#Cassiodorus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e172"><seg type="qs">Tertia gratia</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed prius educavit super aquam refectionis, sed prius animam meam convertit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e180">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e182" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_3@4-4">Deduxit.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps22-Rd1e185"><name xml:id="gom-ps22-Nd1e186" ref="#Cassiodorus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e189">Quarta, quod super charitatis praecepta duxit.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e192">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e194" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_3@6-7">Super semitas.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps22-Rd1e197"><name xml:id="gom-ps22-Nd1e198" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e201">Arctiora mandata et perfectiora consilia, quasi semitis pauci justi ambulant, sicut semitae arctiores sunt quam viae.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps22-Dd1e205">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps22-Hd1e207">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e209">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e211" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_4">Nam et si.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps22-Rd1e216"><name xml:id="gom-ps22-Nd1e217" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e220">Quinta, quod in umbra mortis non timet mala.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e223">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e225" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_4@13-14">Mecum es.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps22-Rd1e228"><name xml:id="gom-ps22-Nd1e229" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e232">In corde per fidem, ut post umbram mortis ego tecum sim.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e235">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e237" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_4@15-16">Virga tua.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps22-Rd1e240"><name xml:id="gom-ps22-Nd1e241" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e244">Sexta, correctio; vel virga districtio, quae convertit vitia. Baculus gubernatio, quae sustinet fideles.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps22-Dd1e249">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps22-Hd1e251">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e253">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0876B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e257" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_5@1-3">Parasti in conspectu.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps22-Rd1e260"><name xml:id="gom-ps22-Nd1e261" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e264">Septima, mensa Domini, beata convivatio, saturitas fidei, esca coelestis, de qua Apostolus: <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e266" source="http://scta.info/resource/Icor11_29@1-11">Qui manducat et bibit indigne, judicium sibi manducat et bibit. In conspectu meo mensam:</quote> etsi non impiorum. De hac dicitur: <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e269">Sed isti ad mensam divitis,</quote> id est, Christi, <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e271">scito et te similia debere praeparare,</quote> id est, pati sicut ipse.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e275">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e277" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_5@11-11">Impinguasti:</quote>
            octava, unctio capitis, scilicet Christi, quod nulla ariditate peccati exaruit, unde caetera laetantur membra, quia capite descendit unguentum in barbam barbam Aaron, et in oram vestimenti ejus.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e281">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e283" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_5@17-19">Et calix meus.</quote>
            Nona, calix, Christi sanguis, qui sic inebriat ut sobrios reddat.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e287">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e289" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_5@19-19">Meus,</quote>
            quia accipio. Vel, tuus, quia das. Mensa et calix, caro, sanguis, quanquam unum sint sacramentum, sub diversis <pb ed="#P" n="0876C"/> tamen speciebus, quia utrumque sumitur, divisim hic ponuntur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps22-Dd1e296">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps22-Hd1e298">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e300">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e302" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_6@1-2">Et misericordia.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps22-Rd1e305"><name xml:id="gom-ps22-Nd1e306" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e309">Decima, misericordia subsequens ad custodiam quae praecedit ad gratiam conferendam.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps22-d1e312">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e314" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps22_6@10-12">Et ut inhabitem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps22-Rd1e317"><name xml:id="gom-ps22-Nd1e318" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps22-Qd1e321">Hoc omnibus superioribus jungitur. Quasi collocasti, educasti, deduxisti, etc., et hoc ideo ut inhabitem.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
